{"en": "52560162", "title": "Beranda OpenELIS Global (Bahasa Indonesia)", "adf": {"type": "doc", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "893d0d88b232"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Selamat datang di ruang dokumentasi OpenELIS Global. OpenELIS Global adalah Sistem Informasi Laboratorium (Laboratory Information System, LIS) sumber terbuka yang digunakan di laboratorium klinis di seluruh dunia. Ruang ini dikelola oleh komunitas OpenELIS Global sebagai sumber acuan yang terus diperbarui untuk dokumentasi produk, implementasi, dan pengembang."}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "c52531a5bf5e"}, "content": [{"type": "emoji", "attrs": {"id": "1f500", "text": "🔀", "shortName": ":twisted_rightwards_arrows:", "localId": "a97540f68e8c"}}, {"type": "text", "text": " "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Navigasi pilih jalur Anda", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/OG/pages/52560162/OpenELIS+Global#Start-here-%E2%80%94-pick-your-path"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "e971d327aa0b"}, "content": [{"type": "emoji", "attrs": {"id": "atlassian-logo_jira_product_discovery", "text": ":logo_jira_product_discovery:", "shortName": ":logo_jira_product_discovery:", "localId": "c0a773038468"}}, {"type": "text", "text": " "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Navigasi produk OpenELIS", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/OG/pages/52560162/OpenELIS+Global#OpenELIS-Product-Navigation"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "41be6b1a5954"}, "content": [{"type": "emoji", "attrs": {"id": "atlassian-question_mark", "text": ":question_mark:", "shortName": ":question_mark:", "localId": "23d455eeb8fa"}}, {"type": "text", "text": " "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Dapatkan bantuan & tetap mutakhir", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/OG/pages/52560162/OpenELIS+Global#%3Aquestion_mark%3A-Get-help-%26-stay-current"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}]}, {"type": "rule", "attrs": {"localId": "7b6e56c45ef7"}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "d25bd101b656"}, "content": [{"type": "emoji", "attrs": {"id": "1f500", "text": "🔀", "shortName": ":twisted_rightwards_arrows:", "localId": "7ec155e3757b"}}, {"type": "text", "text": " Mulai di sini: pilih jalur Anda"}]}, {"type": "layoutSection", "attrs": {"localId": "20e13f57a369"}, "marks": [{"type": "breakout", "attrs": {"mode": "wide", "width": 760}}], "content": [{"type": "layoutColumn", "attrs": {"width": 50.0, "localId": "18c6b2892af0"}, "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "0426aab89e40"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "👩‍🔬 Untuk petugas laboratorium", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1326972929"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "02c4ad7bc996"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pengguna akhir (teknisi laboratorium, ahli biologi, dokter spesialis patologi) dan administrator laboratorium. Manual pengguna akhir + referensi singkat, manual administrator + referensi singkat, buku catatan laboratorium, French / Fonctionnalités d'OpenELIS."}]}]}, {"type": "layoutColumn", "attrs": {"width": 50.0, "localId": "7dd663583be5"}, "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "bb12d97d07b3"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "🚀 Untuk tim implementasi", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1326252042"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "f895aed2d420"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Menerapkan OpenELIS Global di situs atau negara baru. Pemasangan & pembaruan versi, penerapan, integrasi OpenMRS & Odoo, Configuration Initializer, Single Sign On, penerjemahan, implementasi di negara."}]}]}]}, {"type": "layoutSection", "attrs": {"localId": "45d2cb375c3c"}, "marks": [{"type": "breakout", "attrs": {"mode": "wide", "width": 760}}], "content": [{"type": "layoutColumn", "attrs": {"width": 50.0, "localId": "c279766e51f1"}, "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "52012d2e80ff"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "👩‍💻 Untuk pengembang", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1326481413"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "86ea51022382"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Insinyur yang menyumbangkan kode, membangun integrasi, atau memperluas OpenELIS Global. Lingkungan pengembangan, FHIR Implementation Guide, kerangka kerja QA, RBAC teknis, pengantar domain laboratorium bagi kontributor baru."}]}]}, {"type": "layoutColumn", "attrs": {"width": 50.0, "localId": "02f95323e7b4"}, "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "9fac9e525df4"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "⚙️ Untuk administrator sistem dan operator", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1325793288"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "c328d780f22e"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Menjalankan OpenELIS Global di lingkungan produksi. Pencadangan (backup), failover HA, migrasi kata sandi, pembaruan versi (upgrade), pemecahan masalah, operasi Consolidated Server."}]}]}]}, {"type": "layoutSection", "attrs": {"localId": "eb66743663d5"}, "marks": [{"type": "breakout", "attrs": {"mode": "wide", "width": 760}}], "content": [{"type": "layoutColumn", "attrs": {"width": 50.0, "localId": "da8b908a1f73"}, "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "704c4e78a8d4"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "🤝 Komunitas", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1326055432"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "a5cc25530585"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Tempat komunitas OpenELIS Global berkumpul, cara berkontribusi, GSoC, Relawan Bulan Ini, catatan rapat, panduan gaya. Tautan forum Talk + GitHub tersedia di dalamnya."}]}]}, {"type": "layoutColumn", "attrs": {"width": 50.0, "localId": "c9cd7f5474b9"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "1cdc5f2412c9"}}]}]}, {"type": "rule", "attrs": {"localId": "294220334ed9"}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "bd9c8b0e96a0"}, "content": [{"type": "emoji", "attrs": {"id": "atlassian-logo_jira_product_discovery", "text": ":logo_jira_product_discovery:", "shortName": ":logo_jira_product_discovery:", "localId": "ebf2ab88-9ddd-4bb3-a82e-390e74e7ccb3"}}, {"type": "text", "text": " Navigasi produk OpenELIS"}]}, {"type": "layoutSection", "attrs": {"localId": "cd3f5436-5dcb-46b3-905e-a751edbf9315"}, "marks": [{"type": "breakout", "attrs": {"mode": "wide", "width": 760}}], "content": [{"type": "layoutColumn", "attrs": {"width": 50.0, "localId": "8732d2b2-1bbe-4e4d-a21e-022ba916f3e4"}, "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "e225072ceeaf"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "ℹ️ Tentang OpenELIS Global", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/239337475"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "304a4b1d9ca2"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Gambaran umum proyek, misi, sejarah, mitra utama.  Mulailah di sini jika Anda ingin memahami apa yang ditawarkan OpenELIS Global secara keseluruhan.  Anda juga dapat mengakses situs web utama kami di "}, {"type": "inlineCard", "attrs": {"localId": "2bf63720bf3a", "url": "https://openelis-global.org/"}}, {"type": "text", "text": " "}]}]}, {"type": "layoutColumn", "attrs": {"width": 50.0, "localId": "98e0158f-2e57-45f0-a539-de201731b0c6"}, "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "f8566c785c62"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "🧩 Modul & fitur", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1325727762"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "4b896727facd"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Satu halaman per modul. RBAC, tanda tangan elektronik, katalog pemeriksaan, penyimpanan sampel, PME, Westgard, pengiriman sampel, manajemen pasien, laporan, dan lebih dari 20 lainnya."}]}]}]}, {"type": "layoutSection", "attrs": {"localId": "b6faaf81a359"}, "marks": [{"type": "breakout", "attrs": {"mode": "wide", "width": 760}}], "content": [{"type": "layoutColumn", "attrs": {"width": 50.0, "localId": "5e4f0ca12daf"}, "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "f9454fde4408"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "📦 Rilis", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1326219273"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "8b456b52800f"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Rilis produksi saat ini, target pengembangan v3.2, Interoperability Roadmap, rilis sebelumnya. "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Pantau halaman ini", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": " agar mendapat pemberitahuan saat rilis baru tersedia."}]}]}, {"type": "layoutColumn", "attrs": {"width": 50.0, "localId": "62cd9c8ebfe1"}, "content": [{"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 3, "localId": "88f59360256f"}, "content": [{"type": "emoji", "attrs": {"id": "atlassian-direct_hit", "text": ":direct_hit:", "shortName": ":direct_hit:", "localId": "804603205d8b"}}, {"type": "text", "text": " "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Peta jalan produk", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/640319495"}}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "1bd3c65a22cf"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Fitur dan fungsi mendatang yang direncanakan untuk dikembangkan dan dirilis."}]}]}]}, {"type": "rule", "attrs": {"localId": "a00333be4df8"}}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "fbdf3ab84c04"}, "content": [{"type": "emoji", "attrs": {"id": "atlassian-question_mark", "text": ":question_mark:", "shortName": ":question_mark:", "localId": "061910d17100"}}, {"type": "text", "text": " Dapatkan bantuan & tetap mutakhir"}]}, {"type": "layoutSection", "attrs": {"localId": "5893a8e45898"}, "marks": [{"type": "breakout", "attrs": {"mode": "wide", "width": 760}}], "content": [{"type": "layoutColumn", "attrs": {"width": 50.0, "localId": "041cedb3b962"}, "content": [{"type": "panel", "attrs": {"panelType": "success", "localId": "ea0d0ff3e469"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "22700fe96cf8"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "🆘 ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "Dapatkan bantuan", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1328185376"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "c7982ff2b096"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Pertanyaan penggunaan, laporan bug, permintaan fitur, perbaikan dokumentasi, bantuan implementasi: saluran yang digunakan untuk masing-masing. Termasuk panduan etika."}]}]}]}, {"type": "layoutColumn", "attrs": {"width": 50.0, "localId": "423fa372c663"}, "content": [{"type": "panel", "attrs": {"panelType": "info", "localId": "aad39fc5f728"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "aafd845f8d37"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "🔔 ", "marks": [{"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "Pantau & tetap mutakhir", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1328316419"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}]}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "03aab48037f4"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Cara berlangganan Confluence, GitHub, dan Talk agar pembaruan dokumentasi sampai kepada Anda tanpa harus Anda cari. Langganan yang direkomendasikan per peran."}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "heading", "attrs": {"level": 2, "localId": "b2b68b4ed846"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Tempat komunitas berkumpul"}]}, {"type": "bulletList", "attrs": {"localId": "12a2126fc4ca"}, "content": [{"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "fd6477897a5f"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "73b03eae65dd"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "talk.openelis-global.org", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://talk.openelis-global.org"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": forum diskusi utama"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "81d76d6cce7b"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "f6b9036237da"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://github.com/DIGI-UW/OpenELIS-Global-2"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": kode sumber, issue, pull request"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "attrs": {"localId": "3e899f68c4b7"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "edda3a3b6d28"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "docs.openelis-global.org", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://docs.openelis-global.org/"}}, {"type": "strong"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": ": dokumentasi pengembang yang dipublikasikan"}]}]}]}, {"type": "rule", "attrs": {"localId": "13dac43589f5"}}, {"type": "paragraph", "attrs": {"localId": "0097ec86ed88"}, "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "📋 "}, {"type": "text", "text": "Rencana kerja pembenahan Confluence", "marks": [{"type": "link", "attrs": {"href": "https://uwdigi.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/oeg/pages/1326120978"}}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "  ·  Terakhir diperbarui 2026-05-21 oleh tim dokumentasi OEG"}]}], "version": 1}}